c":"News24","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxOUU1FYWk4SndKemo4WTVVbXRGMEhIZ3lLQXQwMHpYenlqUXN1dE1GQzlKaml4MFpOWVZlcTZjUEpGeE1QLTBfeWhNUTU0MVY4VlJINFdncDgxZjFNM1ZydVMtWFQwX3IyQUxXUkxaaVBaaWZuM0tUbEt6NTZ6MVY0RklJV0lraU5hb0JJYUhIaG1hU3pwcnN4dThJd3VJcWJaalBPX2Zn?oc=5","date":"2026-11-27","zh":"事情已經板上釘釘：可口可樂裝瓶商易手"},{"title":"The Coca-Cola Company Names David Elkins as Incoming Chief Financial Officer","src":"Business Wire","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxNRHZiNmJfMlZQYk51WXdEUGtmNmhTMDRKQk5QdlRadjZJd3BqQko5VlhmT0tYUGg3N3hCT0FQcUQ4X3puSEloNzB1NDdRY1ZpU0dQMGhaQTEta2JFUUtERVVTOF9wc2cxYUpKVVNtU3J0N1o1bjFsV0d6ZTFlMkNzSGxkMnI4bDg1Qld1YUl6OEtsYm54eXd2M3VRYkkwUmxJcVJmN2tUUHM4NVZLanAyQ1puZUZBaGZnblFxTTJJZUpXTGc2c2laSkl6eVhHZw?oc=5","date":"2026-11-23","zh":""},{"title":"Gaylord Palms has a single Coca-Cola Christmas Suite near Disney World","src":"Pirates and Princesses","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOV2F4RkFDWGhtcHRueXJuNHpjTXdraVZTbEl1TEZBVjhrUzN2Mmp4eHVHQ2owSHh6RnpTUm1uVjMtaGtCRkE4SWNKSlhuRlBPTWl4TUlJeW45TUM4RTdRLXBDYXRrXzVCRVl4WVZXNW9OVzFaRkM4MXBLNDBPMUxxYk15LVRBeUh3NjRQMms3Z0VaN1VuMy1mbEVhSmlhM2tsbmxRdHpjVQ?oc=5","date":"2026-11-22","zh":"蓋洛德棕櫚酒店 (Gaylord Palms) 在迪士尼世界附近設有可口可樂聖誕套房"}],"themes":[{"name":"併購","count":4},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":4},{"name":"財報","count":2},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-20","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/21344/000162828026010047/ko-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"In this report, the terms \"The Coca-Cola Company,\" \"Company,\" \"we,\" \"us\" and \"our\" mean The Coca-Cola Company and all entities included in our consolidated financial statements.","zh":"在本報告中，「可口可樂公司」、「本公司」、「我們」和「我們的」等術語是指可口可樂公司以及我們合併財務報表中包含的所有實體。"},{"en":"The Coca-Cola Company is a total beverage company, and beverage products bearing our trademarks, sold in the United States since 1886, are now sold in more than 200 countries and territories. We own or license and market numerous beverage brands, which we group into the following categories: Trademark Coca-Cola; sparkling flavors; water, sports, coffee and tea; juice, value-added dairy and plant-based beverages; and emerging beverages. We own and market several of the world's largest nonalcoholic sparkling soft drink brands, including Coca-Cola, Sprite, Coca-Cola Zero Sugar, Fanta and Diet Coke/Coca-Cola Light.","zh":"可口可樂公司是一家綜合飲料公司，帶有我們商標的飲料產品自1886年起在美國銷售，現已銷往200多個國家和地區。我們擁有或授權並行銷眾多飲料品牌，我們將其分為以下幾類： 商標 可口可樂；氣泡口味；水、運動、咖啡和茶；果汁、加值乳製品和植物飲料；和新興飲料。我們擁有並銷售多個全球最大的非酒精起泡軟性飲料品牌，包括可口可樂、雪碧、零糖可口可樂、芬達和健怡可樂/淡味可口可樂。"},{"en":"We make our branded beverage products available to consumers throughout the world through our network of independent bottling partners, distributors, wholesalers and retailers as well as our consolidated bottling and distribution operations. Beverages bearing trademarks owned by or licensed to the Company account for 2.2 billion of the estimated 65 billion servings of all beverages consumed worldwide every day.","zh":"我們透過我們的獨立裝瓶合作夥伴、分銷商、批發商和零售商網路以及我們的綜合裝瓶和分銷業務，向世界各地的消費者提供我們的品牌飲料產品。全球每天消耗的所有飲料估計有 650 億份，其中帶有該公司擁有或授權的商標的飲料佔 22 億。"}],"markets":[{"en":"\"concentrates\" means flavorings and other ingredients which, when combined with water and, depending on the product, sweeteners (nutritive or non-nutritive) are used to prepare syrups or finished beverages, and includes powders/minerals for purified water products;","zh":"「濃縮物」是指調味劑和其他成分，當與水和甜味劑（營養性或非營養性）（取決於產品）混合時，用於製備糖漿或成品飲料，並包括用於純化水產品的粉末/礦物質；"},{"en":"\"syrups\" means intermediate products in the beverage manufacturing process produced by combining concentrates with water and, depending on the product, sweeteners (nutritive or non-nutritive);","zh":"「糖漿」是指飲料製造過程中透過將濃縮物與水混合而生產的中間產品，並且根據產品的不同，添加甜味劑（營養性或非營養性）；"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The commercial beverage industry is highly competitive and consists of numerous companies, ranging from small or emerging to very large and well established. These include companies that, like our Company, compete globally in multiple geographic areas, as well as businesses that are primarily regional or local in operation. Competitive products include numerous nonalcoholic sparkling soft drinks; water products, including flavored and enhanced waters; juices, juice drinks and nectars; dilutables (including syrups and powders); coffees; teas; energy drinks; sports drinks; milk and other dairy-based drinks; plant-based beverages; functional beverages, including vitamin-based products and relaxation beverages; and various other nonalcoholic beverages. These competitive products are sold to consumers in both ready-to-drink and non-ready-to-drink form. The Company has directly entered the alc","zh":"商業飲料行業競爭激烈，由眾多公司組成，從小型或新興公司到大型和成熟的公司。其中包括像我們公司這樣在多個地理區域進行全球競爭的公司，以及主要在區域或本地運營的企業。競爭產品包括多種不含酒精的氣泡軟性飲料；水產品，包括調味水和強化水；果汁、果汁飲料和花蜜；稀釋劑（包括糖漿和粉末）；咖啡；茶；能量飲料；運動飲料；牛奶和其他乳製品飲料；植物性飲料；功能性飲料，包括維生素產品和放鬆飲料；和各種其他非酒精飲料。這些具競爭力的產品以即飲型和非即飲型兩種形式出售給消費者。公司直接進入alc"},{"en":"Competitive factors impacting our business include, but are not limited to, pricing, advertising, sales promotion programs, in-store displays and point-of-sale marketing, digital marketing, product and ingredient innovation, availability, increased efficiency in production techniques, the introduction of new packaging as well as new vending and dispensing equipment, contracting with marketing assets (theaters, sports arenas, universities, etc.), and brand and trademark development and protection.","zh":"影響我們業務的競爭因素包括但不限於定價、廣告、促銷計劃、店內展示和銷售點行銷、數位行銷、產品和成分創新、可用性、生產技術效率的提高、新包裝以及新銷售和分配設備的引入、與行銷資產（劇院、體育場館、大學等）簽訂合同，以及品牌和商標的開發和保護。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":19586000000,"zh":"北美洲部門"},{"name":"Europe Middle East Africa","val":11513000000,"zh":"歐洲 中東 非洲"},{"name":"Latin America","val":6334000000,"zh":"拉丁美洲部門"},{"name":"Bottling Investments","val":5735000000,"zh":"裝瓶投資"},{"name":"A.Pacific","val":5638000000,"zh":"太平洋公司"}],"total":47941000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Concentrate Operations","val":28462000000,"zh":"集中營運"},{"name":"Finished Product Operations","val":19479000000,"zh":"成品作業"}],"total":47941000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Non Us","val":28814000000,"zh":"非我們"},{"name":"US","val":19127000000,"zh":"美國"}],"total":47941000000}},"peers":["PG","JNJ","DIS","VZ","JPM"]}}